  "limitations": [
    "The review implicitly acknowledges that the small sample sizes and varied conditions in primary studies limit the ability to conduct meta-analyses for concrete design recommendations.",
    "The review is a narrative review and does not specify formal systematic search strategies or explicit inclusion/exclusion criteria, nor does it include a formal risk of bias assessment for the included studies."
